cy of about three times per year, starting from January 3, 2015. She has not quit using cigars.\n \n- **Alcohol Consumption:** Samantha consumes approximately four alcoholic drinks per week.\n\n---\n\n**Family History:**\n\n- **Father:** Her father has a history of hypertension, which began when he was 65 years old. He is currently 77 years old and is alive.\n\n---\n\n**General Observations:**\n\nDuring the patient's routine follow-up visits, her general health appears to be well-maintained. The physical examination has revealed no significant abnormalities beyond the noted issues of HIV management and episodic rashes. Cardiovascular, respiratory, a"
